kai_gazebo ships worlds built on terrain models from other projects, all
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- Sydney International Regatta Centre and Nathan Benderson Park: models
  from the Virtual RobotX competition (osrf/vrx), fetched from Fuel
  (https://app.gazebosim.org/openrobotics) at run time.
- Sand Island: the VRX 2019 terrain mesh and texture (osrf/vrx,
  gazebo_classic branch, vrx_gazebo/models/sandisland), fetched at build
  time from a pinned commit; its shore camp (post, antenna, ground_station
  with tent, foldable_table and foldable_chair) from Fuel at run time.
- La Spezia marina: the Virtual Ocean Robotics Challenge terrain mesh and
  texture (osrf/vorc, vorc_gazebo/models/marina), fetched at build time
  from a pinned commit.
